1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:00,875
Shalom.

2
00:00:00,835 --> 00:00:02,714
Today you'll learn your first

3
00:00:02,674 --> 00:00:04,494
Hebrew word with Ivrit Sheli.

4
00:00:04,454 --> 00:00:06,564
Let me show you, step by step.

5
00:00:07,384 --> 00:00:10,393
Open this address on your phone or your computer.

6
00:00:11,213 --> 00:00:13,934
Continue with Google to save your progress,

7
00:00:13,894 --> 00:00:16,614
or tap “Explore demo” to look around first.

8
00:00:16,574 --> 00:00:19,336
The first visit can take a few seconds.

9
00:00:20,156 --> 00:00:21,328
You land on “Today”,

10
00:00:21,288 --> 00:00:23,259
your starting point every day.

11
00:00:24,079 --> 00:00:25,157
Another language?

12
00:00:25,117 --> 00:00:26,888
Tap the button at the top and

13
00:00:26,848 --> 00:00:29,139
choose English, Spanish or Hebrew.

14
00:00:29,959 --> 00:00:32,103
Now tap “Start my first lesson”.

15
00:00:33,173 --> 00:00:35,485
Every word has its own painted scene.

16
00:00:35,445 --> 00:00:38,292
Tap “Replay the scene”, and watch it move.

17
00:00:39,962 --> 00:00:41,392
Tap “Hear this word” to hear

18
00:00:41,352 --> 00:00:42,918
how it sounds in Hebrew.

19
00:00:42,988 --> 00:00:44,968
שָׁלוֹם · shalom

20
00:00:45,338 --> 00:00:46,721
Choose what it means.

21
00:00:46,681 --> 00:00:47,393
Wonderful!

22
00:00:47,353 --> 00:00:49,820
Shalom means hello, and also peace.

23
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:52,372
The bar shows your progress:

24
00:00:52,332 --> 00:00:53,943
five words, one at a time.

25
00:00:53,903 --> 00:00:55,985
And “Today” shows your level.

26
00:00:56,805 --> 00:00:57,978
Prefer more light?

27
00:00:57,938 --> 00:01:00,534
Tap the sun, and the app turns bright.

28
00:01:02,404 --> 00:01:03,685
A little every day.

29
00:01:03,645 --> 00:01:06,394
Ivrit Sheli: your Hebrew, at your pace.
